4. Trained adapters — non-commercial, and derived from all of the above
----------------------------------------------------------------------
  https://huggingface.co/machu8/serana-sft
  https://huggingface.co/machu8/serana-dpo

A LoRA adapter is derived from its training data, so these inherit every
constraint above at once: the CC BY-SA obligations of the wiki text, the
Bethesda IP position on the character, and the base model's own licence.

  Base model: Qwen/Qwen3-8B, Apache 2.0. The adapters are weight deltas
  and do not work without it, so its terms apply to any deployment.

Released for research, study, and portfolio review. Not for commercial
use.


